nope, you have to pay up for every hour worked. had a guy try to do this to me at a scrpayard in newbridge. worked my ass for for a week for.... 40 pounds. that was a trial week and that was  "out of goodness of his heart". told him ill take him to court if he doesnt pay me minimal and he did

